	(text "FRANK PGA - one PGA2350 (RP2350B), M2 pinout (same GPIO map as megafrank).\n\nGP0/1  PS/2 mouse CLK/DATA (PS) - shared with J8 UART header (UART0 TX/RX); open JP1 to drop the mouse pull-ups when J8 is used\nGP2/3  PS/2 keyboard CLK/DATA (PS)\nGP4-7  Micro SD (SD)          GP9-11  TDA1387 I2S (AU)\nGP12-19  HDMI + VGA (HV, shared); composite R-ladder on GP12-18\nGP22  Tape in (TP)            GP25  status LED (LD1)\nGP23/24  ESP GPIO2/GPIO0 via 1K, GP36 ESP RST via JP (ES)   GP38/39  UART1 (aux) <-> ESP-01 RX/TX (ES)\nGP28/29  I2C0 DS3231 RTC (RT)\nGP8, 20, 21, 26, 27, 30-35, 37, 40-46 free.  GP47 = PSRAM CS inside PGA2350.\nUSB: 74HC4052 switches the RP2350 USB between USB-C (PC/debug) and the MW7211A hub -> two double USB-A (4 ports)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f484b5b-0c06-41a5-b953-3b9021291874")
	)
